                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Played 8 minutes of this. Coming from Colosseum Road to Freedom, this is a huge downgrade. I understand that it's an online first PVP game, I get it, they didn't want to make a game with traditional progression. But why does the combat feel worse? Magic is a cool inclusion, but the PS2 game had a much better control scheme and had direction based attacks. Also the game doesn't really run well under Linux, but the game wasn't made for Linux, so that one's on me.",
